# Mail Forwarding/Redirecting Activity In O365 | T1020, T1114.003, T1564.008 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-threat-hunting/cloud/m365/audit/microsoft365_susp_email_forwarding_activity.yml
(Operation="*UpdateInboxRules*" (OperationProperties IN ("*Forward*", "*Recipients*"))) OR (Operation="*Set-Mailbox*" (Parameters IN ("*ForwardingSmtpAddress*", "*ForwardingAddress*"))) OR ((Operation IN ("*New-InboxRule*", "*Set-InboxRule*")) (Parameters IN ("*ForwardAsAttachmentTo*", "*ForwardingAddress*", "*ForwardingSmtpAddress*", "*ForwardTo*", "*RedirectTo*", "*RedirectToRecipients*")))
